#: config/audience.c:493
msgid ""
"Double-click someone to pick their avatar by its picture (with a search "
"box). With kikarinhas running, the change takes effect at once. Empty "
"avatar: a random one, always the same. Level: what the chat badges said on "
"the latest message. Trusted: ticked by hand, for commands limited to trusted "
"people and up. Points: double-click to change the balance. People from "
"Stream Avatars without a name or dates: run kikarinhas --import-sa-users "
"once."
msgstr ""
"Double-click someone to pick their avatar by its picture (with a search "
"box). With kikarinhas running, the change takes effect at once. Empty "
"avatar: a random one, always the same. Level: what the chat badges said on "
"the latest message. Trusted: ticked by hand, for commands limited to trusted "
"people and up. Points: double-click to change the balance. People from "
"Stream Avatars without a name or dates: run kikarinhas --import-sa-users "
"once."

